#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md:52
#: 96fb78d937f44f4685aed623c48f659c
msgid ""
"Hand `target_command` / `target_percent` need `target_command_enabled`. "
"Waist topics need `waist_lifting_enabled`. Absolute-pose defaults match "
"**FiveAges W2** (`base_footprint` / `body_base`). README example for "
"**ARX Lift / Lift 2S**: `waist_lifting_type: single_joint` with "
"`base_link` / `lift_link`. Height-only commands (`waist_lifting`, "
"`waist_lifting_command`, `target_joint_position`) do **not** use those "
"frames."
msgstr ""
"手部 `target_command` / `target_percent` 需要 `target_command_enabled`。腰部话题需要"
" `waist_lifting_enabled`。绝对位姿默认对齐 **FiveAges W2**（`base_footprint` / "
"`body_base`）。README 中 **ARX Lift / Lift 2S** 示例：`waist_lifting_type: "
"single_joint`，坐标系 `base_link` / "
"`lift_link`。仅高度命令（`waist_lifting`、`waist_lifting_command`、`target_joint_position`）**不**使用这些坐标系。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md:54
#: 9e3df8056a4b43dab96b2cbde8024b07
#, #
msgid ""
"On **分体**, the body instance is typically `/body_joint_controller/…`. On "
"**全身**, [API_REFERENCE](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) maps the same waist "
"names under `/ocs2_wbc_controller/…`. Cartesian EE `*/twist` and "
"`*/relative` are **not** this controller — [FSM and "
"Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md). Waist pose also has a "
"`WaistLiftingPose` **action** (`…/waist_lifting_pose`); Python prefers "
"`execute_waist_lifting_pose_*_action` when a result is needed."
msgstr "在**分体**上，身体实例通常是 `/body_joint_controller/…`。在**全身**上，[API_REFERENCE](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) 把同样的腰部名字映射到 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/…`。笛卡尔末端 `*/twist` 与 `*/relative` **不是**本控制器 — [FSM 与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。腰部位姿还有 `WaistLiftingPose` **Action**（`…/waist_lifting_pose`）；需要结果时 Python 更推荐 `execute_waist_lifting_pose_*_action`。"

